# Pages exempt from the locale parity check.
#
# One repo-relative path per line. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
# Everything after `#` on a line is treated as a comment, so record the reason
# inline. The `locale parity` check reports exempt pages separately rather than
# counting them as gaps.
#
# Exempt a page only when translating it is genuinely impractical. A page that
# is merely untranslated *yet* should stay in the gap list so it keeps showing
# up in the report.

changelog.mdx  # append-only release log; every entry would need 4 translations forever
